# Server-Sent Event view fragments. Spring rates this Low. It applies only when an
# application renders view fragments into an event stream. This API sends JSON run
# events and does not render views. The open-source fix is Spring Framework 7.0.9;
# the 6.2 patch is enterprise-only.
CVE-2026-47890
